{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/6d42706321f74e7581b6d34570889416/snapshots/89259b9688bf44e3959570a033acfa95-00004.jpg\"/><p>黑龍江海林市橫道河子鎮，在秋季迎來一年之中的最美景致。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8504219_黑龍江橫道河子秋色與俄式街景引客 - 截图7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/6d42706321f74e7581b6d34570889416/snapshots/89259b9688bf44e3959570a033acfa95-00007.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>隨着秋意加深，山坡換上最豐富的色彩，紅、綠、金黃的葉子在山間層層疊疊，加上罕見的俄羅斯式街景，構成濃厚的秋日畫面，迎接各地遊客。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8504219_黑龍江橫道河子秋色與俄式街景引客 - 截图5\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/6d42706321f74e7581b6d34570889416/snapshots/89259b9688bf44e3959570a033acfa95-00005.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>橫道河子素有「火車拉來的小鎮」之稱，建立於19世紀末。當時俄羅斯人隨中國東方鐵路建設，在當地興建火車維修工場等設施。鎮內保存完好的歷史建築，令橫道河子成為受歡迎的旅遊目的地。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.879413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T22:17:36.147610+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.652182+00:00","content_hash":"8c71b5344e16d6c75fe1d9ac7ed1fbbb9769a5a59ea5fc498a68bc87bcc331ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.879413+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}